--   967 Axel Adler Scholarship for Sustainability (University of Gothenburg) (rel 10)
--   968 KTH One-Year Scholarship      (rel 10)
--   969 KTH Joint Programme Scholarship (rel 10)
-- sources 3102 (KTH One-Year page) / 3103 (KTH Joint Programme page);
-- links 967->2533 (existing Axel Adler page source), 968->3102, 969->3103;
-- university_scholarships 697 (GU university 136), 698/699 (KTH university 86).
